          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "j4d3xh8m5i70",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Major Activities in "
            },
            {
              "_key": "f7mbrsv63bbl",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "bp6inr4bij2b"
              ],
              "text": "Safaga"
            },
            {
              "_key": "l5xsmncq3gvq",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": A Blend of Adventure and Relaxation"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "bp6inr4bij2b",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58920",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Safaga, a picturesque town on Egypt’s Red Sea coast, is not just a scenic retreat but a hub of exhilarating activities and relaxing experiences. Whether you’re an adventure seeker or in search of tranquility, Safaga offers a range of activities that cater to every preference. Let’s explore the major activities that make Safaga a must-visit destination for travelers from around the world."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000011",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Diving and Snorkeling"
            },
            {
              "_key": "osderwpza6lp",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Safaga has established itself as a premier destination for snorkeling and scuba diving, competing on an international scale with renowned sites like "
            },
            {
              "_key": "nwg3xiiu7htn",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "cnkzz96bsie3"
              ],
              "text": "Sharm El Sheikh"
            },
            {
              "_key": "yz63vw3wbd3d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " and "
            },
            {
              "_key": "rxbfmis82f3f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "lograh5ov6ye"
              ],
              "text": "Hurghada"
            },
            {
              "_key": "pddfdawvjpzy",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The town offers ideal diving conditions, including exceptional visibility, controlled winds, and easy offshore dives, making it perfect for both novice and experienced divers."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The marine life in Safaga is diverse and vibrant, ideal for underwater exploration."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Families and individuals can enjoy boat trips for a more sedate experience, combining sunbathing, snorkeling, and fine dining amidst the serene blue waters."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Qualified dive instructors and certified diving centers are available, offering top-notch services and quality equipment rental."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Recommended Dive Sites:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Tobia Arbaa"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": Known for its seven ergs, this site is a paradise for snorkelers and families, offering a tranquil island experience and an ideal starting point for open water diving courses."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Abu Qifan"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": A 300m long reef, perfect for adventurous divers seeking encounters with hammerhead sharks and manta rays."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Panorama Reef"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": The largest reef in Safaga, known for its vast plateau, rich drop-offs, and unique marine life, making it a site worth diving into multiple times."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "cnkzz96bsie3",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58927",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            },
            {
              "_key": "lograh5ov6ye",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58859",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000018",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Relaxation and Spas"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Safaga is not only about adventure; it’s also a haven for relaxation and natural healing."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Karlovy Vary Spa, located at the Menaville, is an accredited branch of the Czech Republic’s health clinic and spa. It’s particularly popular among international travelers due to Safaga’s warm weather year-round."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Visitors can indulge in a variety of therapies and treatments, such as hydrotherapy, oxygen therapy, and wax therapy, all offered at reasonable prices."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Whether you’re dealing with asthma, bronchitis, muscle pain, stress, or tension, Safaga’s natural environment promises healing and rejuvenation."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Guests can enjoy mineral pools, spas, and relaxing massages with a view of the tranquil beach."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In Safaga, activities range from the thrill of diving into the depths of the Red Sea to the serene pleasure of a spa treatment. This charming town offers a perfect blend of excitement and relaxation, ensuring that every visitor leaves with unforgettable memories and a rejuvenated spirit. Whether you’re plunging into the underwater world or unwinding in a spa, Safaga’s natural beauty and therapeutic offerings are sure to captivate and heal."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001b",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Safaga-City-Safaga-Shore-Excursions.jpg",
